# A collection of the less common request shapes.

### Login form
POST https://api.example.com/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username={{user}}&password={{pass}}

### Upload avatar
POST https://api.example.com/avatars
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="caption"

my holiday photo
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="avatar.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./assets/avatar.png
--WebAppBoundary--

### SOAP call
POST https://api.example.com/soap
Content-Type: application/xml

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<soap:Envelope xmlns:soap="http://schemas.xmlsoap.org/soap/envelope/">
  <soap:Body>
    <GetThing><Id>{{thingId}}</Id></GetThing>
  </soap:Body>
</soap:Envelope>

### Raw text ping
// no method given on purpose, defaults to GET
https://api.example.com/ping

<> previous-response.200.json
